          "check": "card-covered",
          "criterion": "card-covered@5",
          "input": "[CARD]\n원하는 것: 반복 일정. event.add에 repeat 입력(\"none\" 또는 \"weekly\", 주지 않으면 \"none\")을 더한다\n정해 둔 답: 반복은 매주(weekly)만. weekly이면 start부터 매주 같은 요일·같은 시각으로 모두 4번 나타난다. 지금 있는 일정과 tool 이름·입력, 알림은 시작 10분 전, 한 주는 월요일~일요일 그대로\n모르는 것: 그 밖의 전부 → \"추천대로 해 줘\"\n\n[DECLARATION]\n- event.add (write): Save one new event and schedule a reminder 10 minutes before it starts. input={\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"repeat\":{\"description\":\"none (default) makes one event; weekly repeats it every week at the same weekday and time from the start, and reminds for the next 52 weeks.\",\"enum\":[\"none\",\"weekly\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"start\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"description\":\"The local start time of the event.\",\"properties\":{\"day\":{\"description\":\"The day of the month of the start.\",\"maximum\":31,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"hour\":{\"description\":\"The hour of the start, 0 to 23.\",\"maximum\":23,\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"minute\":{\"description\":\"The minute of the start, 0 to 59.\",\"maximum\":59,\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"month\":{\"description\":\"The month of the start, 1 to 12.\",\"maximum\":12,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"year\":{\"description\":\"The year of the start.\",\"maximum\":2100,\"minimum\":2000,\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"day\",\"hour\",\"minute\",\"month\",\"year\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"title\":{\"description\":\"The title of the new event.\",\"maxLength\":200,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"start\",\"title\"],\"type\":\"object\"}\n- event.list (read): Read the saved events, earliest first, for this week, next week or all. input={\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"range\":{\"description\":\"Which events to read: all, this week or next week. Weeks start on Monday.\",\"enum\":[\"all\",\"this_week\",\"next_week\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}\n- event.remove (write): Remove one event. Removing an id that does not exist is not an error. input={\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"description\":\"The id of the event to remove.\",\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"id\"],\"type\":\"object\"}\nconnection: app_0000000000000000000000ntfy -> notify.schedule\n\n[DESIGN]\n# 반복 일정 (변경)\n- event.add 입력 `repeat`: \"none\"(기본, 일정 하나) | \"weekly\"(start부터 매주 같은 요일·시각).\n- 저장: event 행 하나 + repeat 칸(migration 1-2). 반복은 event.list 때 펼친다(같은 id, 여러 start). 전체 목록과 알림은 52회까지, 주 범위는 해당 주의 것.\n- 알림: weekly면 52회 모두 notify.schedule. 하나라도 실패하면 reminder \"failed\".\n- event.remove(id)는 모든 반복을 지운다.\n",
          "state": "judged",
          "model": "claude-haiku-5-5",
